## Membaca Request

`*http.Request` mengandung semua informasi tentang request yang masuk:

```go
func handler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {
	// Method
	fmt.Println("Method:", r.Method) // GET, POST, PUT, DELETE

	// URL dan path
	fmt.Println("URL:", r.URL.Path)      // /api/users
	fmt.Println("Query:", r.URL.RawQuery) // name=alice&age=30

	// Query parameters
	name := r.URL.Query().Get("name")

	// Headers
	contentType := r.Header.Get("Content-Type")
	auth := r.Header.Get("Authorization")

	// Form data (POST, application/x-www-form-urlencoded)
	r.ParseForm()
	email := r.FormValue("email")

	_ = name; _ = contentType; _ = auth; _ = email
}
```

## Membaca Request Body (JSON)

```go
package main

import (
	"encoding/json"
	"fmt"
	"net/http"
)

type CreateUserReq struct {
	Name  string `json:"name"`
	Email string `json:"email"`
	Age   int    `json:"age"`
}

func createUserHandler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {
	if r.Method != http.MethodPost {
		http.Error(w, "Method not allowed", http.StatusMethodNotAllowed)
		return
	}

	var req CreateUserReq
	if err := json.NewDecoder(r.Body).Decode(&req); err != nil {
		http.Error(w, "Invalid JSON: "+err.Error(), http.StatusBadRequest)
		return
	}
	defer r.Body.Close()

	// Gunakan req.Name, req.Email, req.Age
	w.Header().Set("Content-Type", "application/json")
	w.WriteHeader(http.StatusCreated)
	json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(map[string]any{
		"message": "User created",
		"name":    req.Name,
	})
}
```

## http.Error & Status Codes

```go
// Helper untuk error response
http.Error(w, "Not Found", http.StatusNotFound)         // 404
http.Error(w, "Bad Request", http.StatusBadRequest)      // 400
http.Error(w, "Unauthorized", http.StatusUnauthorized)   // 401
http.Error(w, "Internal Error", http.StatusInternalServerError) // 500

// Redirect
http.Redirect(w, r, "/new-path", http.StatusMovedPermanently) // 301
```

## Membaca URL Path Segment

Dengan Go 1.22+, router bawaan mendukung pattern lebih canggih:

```go
// Go 1.22+ pattern matching
mux.HandleFunc("GET /users/{id}", func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {
	id := r.PathValue("id")
	fmt.Fprintf(w, "User ID: %s", id)
})
```

